          "efe369f0-31da-4618-8ec9-bde9ebc6ac07": {
            "type": "html",
            "settings": {
              "code": "<div class=\"our-power-item\">\n<br>\n<h2>Quality Ingredients You Can Feel\n</h2>\n<br>\n\n<h4 class=\"title\">MAGNESIUM</h4>\n<p>Powered by polymer technology, 1HR-A delivers magnesium directly through the skin to working muscles. This helps restore muscle and skin tissue for faster recovery.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"our-power-item\">\n<h4 class=\"title\">ZINC</h4>\n<p>Topical zinc has anti-inflammatory and healing properties. It also combats acne, eczema, rosacea, and dandruff thanks to its antifungal effects.</p>\n</div>",
              "width": "33%"
            }
          },
          "45202243-21f9-451b-b390-ede4a2193448-1676531578aa4d4874-1": {
            "type": "image",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/MicrosoftTeams-image_540x_56dfe337-1a96-42c2-8778-38a9bab979d3.webp",
              "width": "33%",
              "alignment": "bottom-middle"
            }
          },
          "989a5b0c-b479-4e4c-91a6-339ee8de9407": {
            "type": "html",
            "settings": {
              "code": "<div class=\"our-power-item\">\n<h4 class=\"title\">AMINO ACIDS</h4>\n<p>Sweating depletes moisture from skin and hair, but amino acids help restore it. These antioxidants support hydration, leaving hair soft and strong.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"our-power-item\">\n<h4 class=\"title\">vitamin e, b3, b5</h4>\n<p>This vitamin blend soothes inflammation while hydrating and strengthening skin and hair. The result: replenished, refueled, and rehydrated tissue.</p>\n</div>",
              "width": "33%"
            }
          }
        },
